{
    "word": "shimmery",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "3aae1068-f3d9-3af1-9156-815e30f9013b",
                "word": "shimmery",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b957efc1-e165-4599-b048-32a3052a6964",
                        "entry_id": "3aae1068-f3d9-3af1-9156-815e30f9013b",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "shimmerier"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "896d6f70-7e88-45b6-b4a7-5be0a6085379",
                        "entry_id": "3aae1068-f3d9-3af1-9156-815e30f9013b",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "shimmeriest"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b520d81a-138d-3b88-87ed-cd66ac2bdd9a",
                        "entry_id": "3aae1068-f3d9-3af1-9156-815e30f9013b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "shimmering, or shining with a faint, or intermittent or trembling gleam or light."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "35724fd1-cf26-43a3-ad06-eedc4a569e20",
                                "sense_id": "b520d81a-138d-3b88-87ed-cd66ac2bdd9a",
                                "text": "He had not known him at first; at least not for certain in the shimmery moonlight; the man he had seen looked younger and of lighter build, he said, and he had not taken him to be his old friend and mate; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56e372c1-35b1-431d-a8ae-92f986f4402a",
                                "sense_id": "b520d81a-138d-3b88-87ed-cd66ac2bdd9a",
                                "text": "There will always be something worth living for while there are shimmery afternoons."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f36419e-e49d-4767-be83-d1f6448e24fc",
                                "sense_id": "b520d81a-138d-3b88-87ed-cd66ac2bdd9a",
                                "text": "The length of the gorge on both sides was hung as it were with black shimmery velvet curtains, and Mowgli sank as he looked, for those were the clotted millions of the sleeping bees."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfc78c37-a782-4abc-b842-c704cb1b648d",
                                "sense_id": "b520d81a-138d-3b88-87ed-cd66ac2bdd9a",
                                "text": "And then, far off, around a curve of silver track, comes the trolley, balanced on four small steel-blue wheels, and it is painted the color of tangerines. Epaulets of shimmery brass cover it and pipings of gold; and its chrome bell bings if the ancient motorman taps it with a wrinkled shoe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23566e98-5ba3-4793-ad20-72c715c6ef69",
                                "sense_id": "b520d81a-138d-3b88-87ed-cd66ac2bdd9a",
                                "text": "The tall girl is the shimmeriest, lips painted the color of the inside of an oyster shell, eyelids swirled in mother-of-pearl."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0523f5c0-f013-4ee3-9741-f1789d314592",
                                "sense_id": "b520d81a-138d-3b88-87ed-cd66ac2bdd9a",
                                "text": "[…] Aunty Ada would base her prostitute judgment on Nia’s lipstick, a shimmery orange, and the eye shadow—similar to the shade of the lipstick—that clung to her heavy lids."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "505d6335-66b3-4ed3-b0f9-5c4c36071c6b",
                                "sense_id": "b520d81a-138d-3b88-87ed-cd66ac2bdd9a",
                                "text": "She was the most beautiful of all the mermaids, her hair shinier, her tail shimmerier, her voice more captivating than any other fish-girl’s."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dafa5873-b26b-386a-b9da-fcfb0954d6ac",
                        "entry_id": "3aae1068-f3d9-3af1-9156-815e30f9013b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(Apparently) shaking or trembling."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3046d565-9a72-4746-96cb-1ed712b5a992",
                                "sense_id": "dafa5873-b26b-386a-b9da-fcfb0954d6ac",
                                "text": "\"How is Mrs. Marvyn?\" said Mrs. Scudder. / \"Kinder thin and shimmery; but she's about,—habin' her eyes eberywar 'n' lookin' into eberyting.[\"]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a18b020d-1d9d-476c-888b-74d91084b8ea",
                        "source_entry_id": "3aae1068-f3d9-3af1-9156-815e30f9013b",
                        "source_sense_description": "(apparently) shimmering, or shining with a faint, or intermittent or trembling gleam or light",
                        "target_lang_word": "chatoyant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chatoyant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c969baf6-3500-3524-b227-b0c3408b4fd3",
                                        "entry_id": "ed5a829a-0e52-3464-9b0e-a88afe86e709",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui chatoie, qui semble changer de couleur, comme l’œil-de-chat, suivant les différents aspects sous lesquels il est vu, en parlant d’un objet, d’un être vivant ou d’une entité physique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Optique"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "564d5365-e417-46f5-86ca-8e5fbcd9a1ab",
                                                "sense_id": "c969baf6-3500-3524-b227-b0c3408b4fd3",
                                                "text": "Les mouches étaient toutes distinguées les unes des autres ; il y en avait de dorées, d'argentées, de tigrées, de rembrunies, de chatoyantes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ade3db98-89ca-419a-8827-19105926c028",
                                                "sense_id": "c969baf6-3500-3524-b227-b0c3408b4fd3",
                                                "text": "Éméraude, tu dors, dans l’écrin de feuillage,\n Radieuse dans l’onde au chatoyant mirage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "affee91f-5590-42bf-9023-f05d108ed331",
                                                "sense_id": "c969baf6-3500-3524-b227-b0c3408b4fd3",
                                                "text": "Je regarde les fleurs, le gazon vert, la maison blanche, la rivière chatoyante au soleil et je ressens une béatitude infinie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "209d76a9-21af-4dcf-a992-33090af8010e",
                                                "sense_id": "c969baf6-3500-3524-b227-b0c3408b4fd3",
                                                "text": "La vitre constellée de chiures de mouches renvoyait à Tsi-Tsi le reflet chatoyant de son corsage jaune canari."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "156cd755-dc1d-47ab-964f-2131ebc5c382",
                                                "sense_id": "c969baf6-3500-3524-b227-b0c3408b4fd3",
                                                "text": "Afin de nourrir sa fascination pour les couleurs chatoyantes des pelotes de laine et des écheveaux de coton qui s'alignent sur les rayonnages de la mercerie de son village, sa mère lui enseigne le crochet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c371e17b-9017-369f-a454-952558c6fb3b",
                                        "entry_id": "ed5a829a-0e52-3464-9b0e-a88afe86e709",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dit d’un style brillant et varié, fleuri, orné."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27311037-3af5-4d18-8042-779baf5a651a",
                                                "sense_id": "c371e17b-9017-369f-a454-952558c6fb3b",
                                                "text": "Style chatoyant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db9fef71-5bd6-4fec-811b-cb66b7f6d145",
                                                "sense_id": "c371e17b-9017-369f-a454-952558c6fb3b",
                                                "text": "Tous ses mots, ciselés au tranchant du savoir,\n Dans le quartz éternel des onyx & des prases,\n Constellent, chatoyants, le brocart de ses phrases."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21e8f2ff-2f06-429f-b7a0-14d08d5a110f",
                                                "sense_id": "c371e17b-9017-369f-a454-952558c6fb3b",
                                                "text": "Nous verrons germer dans nos têtes\n Les sonnets aux chaudes odeurs,\n Les strophes aux rimes ailées.\n Le vers chatoyant et gaillard !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "chatoyant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9eec1e5e-75ca-349b-81ef-a57fe59a5f9c",
                                        "entry_id": "46932165-42b3-3720-b22c-9b9a9f714778",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui chatoie, qui est chatoyant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fe369fb-7e09-4788-97d1-8662ef1c8c6a",
                                                "sense_id": "9eec1e5e-75ca-349b-81ef-a57fe59a5f9c",
                                                "text": "Pourquoi dis-tu sans cesse que j’aime le clinquant, le chatoyant, le pailleté ! Poète de la forme ! c’est là le grand mot à outrages que les utilitaires jettent aux vrais artistes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "chatoyant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28146946-2ff4-303c-b27f-f1dd6ce7b90d",
                                        "entry_id": "57151ca7-8e6d-35d2-b1f4-befc3c59c0e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Participe présent de chatoyer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
